{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Server Operating Systems "}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about server operating systems."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Build the application installation program, using IT development tools available in the market, based on solution architecture features.  Understands the concepts of server, its characteristics and its relation with operating systems."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.  Exchanges simple information on the operating systems, server operating systems and relevant information related with the user manual."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Passive-Interrogative Form"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use the <strong>passive voice</strong> <strong>in the present</strong> to emphasize on the action instead of the person who is doing it.</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p>You can use the <strong>passive voice in present</strong> to give more attention to the action. When you use this form, the subject is not important or you don&rsquo;t know it.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Active Voice:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>The association of engineers considers the software very complete.</p> <p><strong>Passive Voice:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <i>The software <strong>is considered</strong> to be very complete</i>.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Take a look at the general structure in questions</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>WH word+ Subject + is/are + Verb in Past Participle + complement?</strong></p> <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p> <p><i>Tips</i>:</p> <p>Remember the subject in the <strong>passive form</strong> used to be the object in the active form.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Which server features are installed first?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What other characteristics are considered important? "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What Is a Server Operating System?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A server operating system is a specific operating system designed to run on servers for different purposes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p>A server operating system (OS) is special software which is installed in servers to enable different roles. The OS determines which role the server is going to have: print, network, mail or database server, among others.</p> <p>The OS in desktops and laptops is not the same as in servers, there are certain specific characteristics of servers OS, some of them are:</p> <ul> <li>Networking capabilities</li> <li>High level security for users, passwords, and data storage.</li> <li>Does not have a GUI (Graphic User Interface), or is optional</li> <li>Advanced backup for critical files</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Note that there are different types of server operating systems based on regular operating systems for regular computers.</p>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "altered "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "changed or modified  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Finally, they also have transparent data transfer, which ensures information is passed through without being altered. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "automation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of making a machine or device work automatically"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Nowadays, server OS also have automation capabilities which allow them to process information by very advanced means, keeping human intervention at minimum levels."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "backup "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a copy of files in reserve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The backup is also an important feature of server operating systems, it is vital for a company to be able to recover their data in case it is lost."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "core "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the central or essential part of something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Remember there are operating systems for regular desktops or laptops, which are the core software that makes computers work. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "feature "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a characteristic  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The backup is also an important feature of server operating systems, it is vital for a company to be able to recover their data in case it is lost."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vital "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very important or relevant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The backup is also an important feature of server operating systems, it is vital for a company to be able to recover their data in case it is lost."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le02ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for more information about Server Operating Systems.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Identify five relevant characteristics of a Server Operating System."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an article describing what a Server Operating System is and the five characteristics you have identified.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your article with your class."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search more information about a Server Operating System. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify five relevant characteristics of a Server Operating System.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an article describing what a Server Operating System is and the five characteristics you have identified."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson and I share my article with my class."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: Hi, Sebastian. Since you&rsquo;re the IT guy, I was hoping you could help me with my homework.</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: Sure, what do you need to know?</p>\n<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: First. What is understood by a server operating system?</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: Remember there are operating systems for regular desktops or laptops, which are the core software that makes computers work. Now, if you have a server, you will also need a particular operating system (OS) for that server. The OS will give the server a particular role and assign it a function as a web, printer, database, or mail server, among others. This role depends on the client&rsquo;s requests.</p>"}, {"time": "43500", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: I see. So it&rsquo;s a software layer that makes the hardware work.</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: Correct.</p>\n<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: What other features are installed in a server?</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: As there are different types of server operating systems their characteristics may vary. However if you have a server, there are certain common characteristics you will find. Some of them do not have a GUI or Graphic User Interface. They are made to improve safety for users, passwords, data storage, and memory protection. The backup is also an important feature of server operating systems, it is vital for a company to be able to recover their data in case it is lost. Weeks or even months of work can be lost!</p>"}, {"time": "90500", "image": "enpe8n6le02ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: Wow! That is an important feature. What other characteristics are considered important?</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: Nowadays, server OS also have automation capabilities which allow them to process information by very advanced means, keeping human intervention at minimum levels. Finally, they also have transparent data transfer, which ensures information is passed through without being altered.</p>\n<p><strong>Lisa</strong>: Well, I think that will do. Thanks!</p>\n<p><strong>Sebastian</strong>: You&rsquo;re welcome!</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le02ob02re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe8n6le02ob02re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_